    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the evil Professor, save the hidden kittens and find a home to live, safely ever after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucifer's Grand Adventure is a 2d platformer where you navigate treacherous terrain by jumping, running and dashing. Some of the collectibles are hidden while others require skillful execution of the controls to access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features classic 2d gameplay with up to 6 possible saves. The game is very speedrun friendly and will have tools to help speedrunners. (timer, quick level/restart functionality)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 2: latest by end of Q3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 3: latest by end of Q4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 4: latest by end of Q1 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 1 patch with either a new level or reworked every 2 weeks until the release of 1.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've been working as a software developer for 11 years and Lucifer's Grand Adventure is my first foray into game development. I hope you'll accompany/support me on the journey to make Lucifer's Grand adventure a successful game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the evil Professor, save the hidden kittens and find a home to live, safely ever after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucifer's Grand Adventure is a 2d platformer where you navigate treacherous terrain by jumping, running and dashing. Some of the collectibles are hidden while others require skillful execution of the controls to access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features classic 2d gameplay with up to 6 possible saves. The game is very speedrun friendly and will have tools to help speedrunners. (timer, quick level/restart functionality)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 2: latest by end of Q3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 3: latest by end of Q4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 4: latest by end of Q1 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 1 patch with either a new level or reworked every 2 weeks until the release of 1.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've been working as a software developer for 11 years and Lucifer's Grand Adventure is my first foray into game development. I hope you'll accompany/support me on the journey to make Lucifer's Grand adventure a successful game.</p>",
    "short_description": "A cute 2D platformer about a cat trying to escape a lab, save all the stray kittens and find a home for all of them to live.",
